              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MariaTheSoaper"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The combination of watermelon and raspberry with the mango created a weird flavor. Could have been the watermelon &amp; raspberry, but maybe removing the lemon juice since both raspberry and mango both have a hint of \"tangy-ness\" might fix the \"off\" flavor. Will try this one again with just a hint of stevia powder to bring additional sweetness."
